| rem_003     | evt_103  | Notification | 10             |

---

### 5. Recurring Events Table (Optional)

| Recurrence ID | Event ID | Frequency | Interval | Until      |
| ------------- | -------- | --------- | -------- | ---------- |
| rec_001       | evt_101  | Weekly    | 1        | 2026-12-31 |

